  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-summary-next-steps-0182dcd7-a9e7-4a14-bd72-b2b4b6809395",
        "text": "Wow! Fayea started with a blank page and used HTML to give her website structure and add all her awesome self-defense content. Her lessons, topics, and even an image are all there!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/e2d688477e041afeb8f74a85d0c8ad56-agathaweb-summary-next-steps-panel-1-4af4d869-9a74-40a2-bc5a-aa6982d7203a.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-summary-next-steps-ae5fb82c-feb0-41fe-8c52-cce865efa9e8",
        "text": "Then, she used CSS to make it beautiful! Changing colors, fonts, and sizes transformed her page from plain text into a vibrant, engaging online dojo.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/d341993b56130da49ce6ce5788759f7f-agathaweb-summary-next-steps-panel-2-5f832570-805f-4e8b-b610-3d2d290f03ef.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-summary-next-steps-6760fa77-0607-416e-a36a-ce278c8d490f",
        "text": "But this is just the beginning! Fayea's website can grow even bigger. She could add more pages for different lessons, create navigation to link them, or explore even more advanced styling.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/70c37c1476b3311726233bc29a0092e1-agathaweb-summary-next-steps-panel-3-6fb114cc-f00c-4639-8fc6-214ddf11be26.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "agathaweb-summary-next-steps-dff953da-755e-48b7-be16-f91e9fb7cd2a",
        "text": "The world of web development is huge, with endless possibilities to explore. Keep learning, keep building, and soon you'll be creating amazing online experiences just like Fayea!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/92727c70baf833554871c0d0ba6964d5-agathaweb-summary-next-steps-panel-4-c411dfdf-cdb7-4826-bcd8-8d49bcb37586.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Summarize what Fayea and the students have learned about creating a basic website using HTML and CSS. Discuss potential next steps for Fayea's website, such as adding more pages, navigation, or more advanced styling, to encourage further learning.",
